#Linux
Sephetho ngola: (Taelo ls -la), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (Tsela /home gabor Desktop), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (Tsela /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Taelo ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Taelo do: ['this'], le: ['that'])), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Tsela go: ['here'], le: ['there'])), mola-o-mocha.